{"nodes": [{"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroshandler", "label": "ChROSHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A handler owns the publishers and subscriptions for exactly one feature (a sensor, a body's state, a control input) and is called at a fixed rate. Adding a ROS pathway means subclassing ChROSHandler and registering an instance with ChROSManager - a single extension point instead of per-feature plumbing."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmanager", "label": "ChROSManager", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Update() ticks each registered handler at its own rate and drains incoming subscriptions, returning false when the node has stopped so the simulation loop can break."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "label": "ChROSBridge", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Handed to Initialize(); creates publishers and subscriptions by topic plus type-name string, serializes and deserializes the message, and exposes DescribeType() for field discovery."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrospublisher", "label": "ChROSPublisher", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NewMessage()/Publish() pair, plus GetSubscriptionCount() so a handler can skip expensive extraction while nobody is subscribed."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmessageview", "label": "ChROSMessageView", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read-side counterpart of the message builder: GetDouble/GetInt/GetString by dotted path, plus GetCount(path) and GetMessage(path, i) for sequences."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_field_by_name_api", "label": "Set/get message fields by dotted path", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because message types are resolved at run time from the sourced ROS environment, fields are addressed by name (e.g. \"header.frame_id\") through typed setters SetBool/SetInt/SetUInt/SetDouble/SetString/SetStringArray, with SetTime for builtin_interfaces/Time and AppendMessage(path) for sequences of nested messages. Unset fields serialize as zero/empty."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_blob_api", "label": "Blob API for bulk primitive arrays", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Camera pixels, lidar points and any T[] bypass the per-field setters and copy the buffer once. SetBlob does not copy - the source buffer must stay alive until Publish() returns within the same Tick() - while SetBlobCopy is the safe variant. In Python any C-contiguous buffer works, and GetMemoryView is zero-copy but valid only inside the callback."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_handler_threading", "label": "Single-threaded handler execution model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subscription callbacks run inside ChROSManager::Update() on the simulation thread, the same thread as Tick(), so reading or writing Chrono objects from a callback needs no locking. The corollary is a prohibition: do not spawn threads that touch Chrono objects or call into a handler."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_simulation_time_rate", "label": "Handler rate measured in simulation time", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The constructor rate is in simulation time so a handler ticks consistently no matter how fast the simulation runs relative to real time; 0 means every step. Wall-clock pacing is left to the application via ChRealtimeStepTimer, and header.stamp fields plus a registered ChROSClockHandler let downstream nodes run with use_sim_time:=true."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_custom_message_packages", "label": "Custom message packages without registration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Any message type whose package is built and sourced in the environment is usable by name with no registration step; if the package is missing, Initialize() fails with an error naming it rather than failing later at publish time."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosqos", "label": "ChROSQoS presets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Optional argument to CreatePublisher/CreateSubscription. Named presets Default(), SensorData(), Clock() and Latched() cover the common cases - Latched is transient-local, needed for latched topics such as /robot_description - with explicit reliability, durability and history depth available underneath."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_python_handlers", "label": "Custom handlers in Python", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pychrono.ros mirrors the C++ handler contract (subclass chros.ChROSHandler, implement Initialize/Tick) but replaces typed setters with item syntax msg[\"field\"] = value, and subscribers subclass chros.ChROSSubscriptionCallback with OnMessage(view)."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroscamerahandler", "label": "ChROSCameraHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroslidarhandler", "label": "ChROSLidarHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosdriverinputshandler", "label": "ChROSDriverInputsHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reference example of a subscriber handler using a custom message package (chrono_ros_interfaces/msg/DriverInputs)."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosclockhandler", "label": "ChROSClockHandler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmanager", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroshandler", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroshandler", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrospublisher", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmessageview", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosqos", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosbridge", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_custom_message_packages", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrospublisher", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_field_by_name_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmessageview", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_field_by_name_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_blob_api", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_field_by_name_api", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chrosmanager", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_handler_threading", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/ros/custom_handlers.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_chroshandler", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_ros_custom_handlers_si